8.2139129638672], "pos": [3834.557373046875, 2815.2607421875], "widgets_values": ["", "该图像是放置在充满活力的阳光田地的岩石表面上的花香瓶的照片。中央位置的香水瓶是矩形的，带有透明的玻璃体和正方形的几何切割，透明的帽子。该瓶装包含金色琥珀色的液体，并带有白色矩形标签，带有黑色文字阅读“ Flor d'Orange”，然后是“ Essencia Natural”和“ Parfum de hoodette”，较小的字母。标签被薄薄的黑线接壤。\n\n在瓶子周围，田野郁郁葱葱，上面有五颜六色的花朵。明亮的橙色万寿菊在背景中占据主导地位，它们的圆形花瓣圆形的花瓣，而白色的雏菊则散布在前景中，增加了对比和深度。花朵盛开，它们的绿色茎和树叶可见，为场景增添了质感。\n\n上面的天空是一个透明，鲜艳的蓝色，有一些柔软的白云，表明晴天，晴天。瓶子静止的岩石表面是浅米色，质地粗糙。整体构图明亮而开朗，花朵的鲜艳色彩和透明的蓝天增强了香水的天然新鲜美感。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 11, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [11], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [424.88970947265625, 262.4027099609375], "pos": [3769.731689453125, 2436.68017578125], "widgets_values": ["english", "chinese (simplified)", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 12, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [4, 5], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [210, 58], "pos": [2623.3837890625, 1599.71728515625], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 17, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 18, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATE